{"id":"b24ed32699fb865e1f1047f8f86378020a5acd4e","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1230589","title":"claude code 封号 会退款吗 需要自己手动申请吗","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"WinX","excerpt":"Claude Code - @WinX -","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/代码\"><li></li> 代码</a><a href=\"/tag/封号\"><li></li> 封号</a><a href=\"/tag/退款\"><li></li> 退款</a></P><p><span>26 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-07-29 19:38:30 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17914944\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c9b138ad0619bf3cff7a67578f544503?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"wheelg\" data-uid=\"440637\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wheelg\">wheelg</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 09:52:48 +08:00\">22h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>同问，快一个月了还没有给我退</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17914957\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/891f/c90e/499149_normal.png?m=1783070382\" alt=\"calvinHxx\" data-uid=\"499149\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/calvinHxx\">calvinHxx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 09:54:49 +08:00\">22h 42m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>得自己退吧 看自己从哪里订阅的吧。如果是 ios 、google 要自己去商店退款</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17914969\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6239/84d7/459132_normal.png?m=1752839109\" alt=\"qW7bo2FbzbC0\" data-uid=\"459132\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/qW7bo2FbzbC0\">qW7bo2FbzbC0</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 09:55:45 +08:00\">22h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>如果是走 app store 或者 play store 的。让 ai 写个退款申请，找下投诉入口，然后提交就行</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17915012\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/97de/a1d1/357935_normal.png?m=1773048351\" alt=\"Harbor0202\" data-uid=\"357935\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Harbor0202\">Harbor0202</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 10:00:09 +08:00\">22h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我对 Apple gift card 订阅有发言权，如果你账号被封，直接去 Apple 支持，选择退款，说明退款原因。<br>基本隔天就到账了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17915016\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8f42/0a93/693025_normal.png?m=1783858790\" alt=\"Jensond\" data-uid=\"693025\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Jensond\">Jensond</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 10:00:30 +08:00\">22h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>退，apple 只退一半。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17915048\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3f22/feff/383743_normal.png?m=1778835129\" alt=\"YanSeven\" data-uid=\"383743\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/YanSeven\">YanSeven</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 10:04:27 +08:00\">22h 32m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>play store 自动按比例退款</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17915196\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ccf6/b199/426485_normal.png?m=1764743469\" alt=\"wuxingli\" data-uid=\"426485\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wuxingli\">wuxingli</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 10:24:09 +08:00\">22h 12m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>App Store 里面订阅的，给我封了，反正没给我退钱</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17915246\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/14f411d95800930f76e79050f41bb65b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ianyagn\" data-uid=\"574584\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ianyagn\">ianyagn</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 10:28:51 +08:00\">22h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我使用 ios 订阅的，使用了半个月，前天封号了，直接在 apple 申请的退款，全额退了，申请到退款不到 24 小时</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17915427\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/af6f/5772/553567_normal.png?m=1782042887\" alt=\"jianqiao031313\" data-uid=\"553567\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jianqiao031313\">jianqiao031313</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 10:49:20 +08:00\">21h 47m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/qW7bo2FbzbC0\">qW7bo2FbzbC0</a> 我用的是 google play ，退款失败。你成功退款了？<br>我刚用了 2 天，就被封了。<br>然后我联系 google 的客服了，人家给我反馈说，只能发起礼貌性退款，让我找开发商去沟通退款事项。<br>google play 的礼貌性退款失败了，然后我就跟 A➗邮件沟通，扯皮了好几封邮件后，A➗说 [经审核您的账户，由于您违反了我们的消费者服务条款，我们无法为您办理订阅退款] </p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17915478\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/af6f/5772/553567_normal.png?m=1782042887\" alt=\"jianqiao031313\" data-uid=\"553567\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jianqiao031313\">jianqiao031313</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 10:55:27 +08:00\">21h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我通过 google play 订阅的 100 刀的 claude code ，被封了，退款失败，谁有辙能退款成功，我分一半给大佬。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17915589\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/81865d92cb26408e850ce0289a7a5e30?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Kokomashiro\" data-uid=\"392987\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Kokomashiro\">Kokomashiro</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 11:10:13 +08:00\">21h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>google play 订阅的 pro ，会退，前天封的，把剩下的用量按比例退了，而且也不用申请，a➗邮件刚发，google play 的退款邮件后脚就收到了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17915604\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/056b1d661b6efaeae4dad3a434082a4f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"qiuyue\" data-uid=\"412842\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/qiuyue\">qiuyue</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 11:12:07 +08:00\">21h 24m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>借楼问下，苹果美区 Apple Id 订阅 ChatGPT 或 Claude，我目前知道同一个 Apple Id 只能给一个 ChatGPT 订阅。请问 Claude 订阅有这个绑定规则吗，就是说 Claude 账号被封后，还可以用原来的美区 Apple Id 给别的 Claude 账号订阅吗？有没有大佬可以告知下，感谢。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17916344\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/605cb34ac10de5411980a201aa35cb6c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"BretTaylor\" data-uid=\"574666\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/BretTaylor\">BretTaylor</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 13:49:37 +08:00\">18h 47m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不是封号瞬间给你退的，手动申请也不退。要找支付方申诉。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17916366\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/280f/10f2/583411_normal.png?m=1750451208\" alt=\"zhhmax\" data-uid=\"583411\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zhhmax\">zhhmax</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 13:52:53 +08:00\">18h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>如果是直接用银行卡支付的订阅基本上会在封号的那一刻退款，如果是走苹果/谷歌订阅的话要自己联系平台退。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17916388\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4676b54daa0f44b885474248e64b6972?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ntdll\" data-uid=\"148771\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ntdll\">ntdll</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 13:55:27 +08:00\">18h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>GooglePlay 是不退款的（超过订阅 48 小时后），需要自行联系开发者协商。</p><p>Google Play 会退款的一般情况下是付费应用本身的费用。而应用内购产生的费用，通常都是不处理的，要求用户自己联系开发者。</p><p>当然，要是 Google 账户不重要的话，可以像付款渠道申请付款争议（银行/PayPal ），让他们直接止付</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17916451\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1cce/89b9/510062_normal.png?m=1753840846\" alt=\"ldyisbest\" data-uid=\"510062\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>25</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ldyisbest\">ldyisbest</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 14:08:07 +08:00\">18h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>google play 买的 封号的时候自动帮我发起了退款 按剩余天数退的  <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/kNBwbLJ.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kNBwbLJ.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17918143\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a5b3aee0373a798d8008d57677feac6c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"JackeyLee233\" data-uid=\"788851\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>26</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/JackeyLee233\">JackeyLee233</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 19:38:30 +08:00\">12h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>Apple 订阅的需要手动去官方的通道申请才会退 一般一两天就有结果了 基本上申请就给退 具体操作细节可以搜索小红书</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"代码 封号 退款26 replies • 2026-07-29 19:38:30 +08:00 1 wheelg 22h 44m ago 同问，快一个月了还没有给我退 2 calvinHxx 22h 42m ago 得自己退吧 看自己从哪里订阅的吧。如果是 ios 、google 要自己去商店退款 3 qW7bo2FbzbC0 22h 41m ago 如果是走 app store 或者 play store 的。让 ai 写个退款申请，找下投诉入口，然后提交就行 4 Harbor0202 22h 36m ago 我对 Apple gift card 订阅有发言权，如果你账号被封，直接去 Apple 支持，选择退款，说明退款原因。基本隔天就到账了。 5 Jensond 22h 36m ago 退，apple 只退一半。 8 YanSeven 22h 32m ago play store 自动按比例退款 10 wuxingli 22h 12m ago App Store 里面订阅的，给我封了，反正没给我退钱 11 ianyagn 22h 8m ago 我使用 ios 订阅的，使用了半个月，前天封号了，直接在 apple 申请的退款，全额退了，申请到退款不到 24 小时 12 jianqiao031313 21h 47m ago @qW7bo2FbzbC0 我用的是 google play ，退款失败。你成功退款了？我刚用了 2 天，就被封了。然后我联系 google 的客服了，人家给我反馈说，只能发起礼貌性退款，让我找开发商去沟通退款事项。google play 的礼貌性退款失败了，然后我就跟 A➗邮件沟通，扯皮了好几封邮件后，A➗说 [经审核您的账户，由于您违反了我们的